  (label "+5V" (at 345.44 119.38 90) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "642ca490-d14c-49aa-a5ca-27db8ea5823e"))
  (label "GND" (at 345.44 127.00 270) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid "1aed3fe6-de82-4e77-a1e6-24404a158fe8"))
  (text "Bench programming: writes the 512K flash image from the Pico with the card OUT of the 2068, powered from the Pico's USB." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 278 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "03e36ecb-5cd8-4a2e-9d63-4a046f707f6e"))
  (text "Chain: SER = D1_L (GP3, SPI0 TX), SRCLK = D0_L (GP2, SPI0 SCK), RCLK = SD_CS (GP28). 24 bits: U12 = A0-A7, U14 = A8-A13, /RD, flash /WE; U15 = D0-D7 through RN1/RN2 4.7k." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 282 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6a44fea5-8342-4ac7-b427-59dbd7ed8e18"))
  (text "Read-back: U15 outputs high, /RD low, then U6 (/U6_EN low, DIR from /IORQ high) carries the flash byte to GP2-GP9. The 4.7k lets the flash win." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 286 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c12bd670-b1e1-4aff-94ed-8fa28adfdebe"))
  (text "Enable (nPROG low) needs SW4 in PROG and USB VBUS present and no +15 V on edge pin B3. In the 2068 the outputs stay off; RCLK and SRCLK toggling there is harmless." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 290 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "08eeed39-2beb-4777-a37a-5d6c7716668b"))
  (text "Pico GP19 (flash /CE) high while SD_CS toggles for SD traffic, so garbage latched into the chain never reaches the flash." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 294 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "11c1fe51-40ac-4108-bc6e-a860cce6e889"))
  (embedded_fonts no)
)
